      <title>Senate wraps up its budget work. House still going</title>
      <link>https://www.wyomingpublicmedia.org/politics-government/2026-02-20/senate-wraps-up-its-budget-work-house-still-going</link>
      <description>Lawmakers are racing to mark up the spending bill that funds state operations for the next two years. Once the House finishes its work, the two marked-up bills will go to a Joint Conference Committee that will try to arrive at a unified bill.</description>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.wyomingpublicmedia.org/politics-government/2026-02-20/senate-wraps-up-its-budget-work-house-still-going</guid>
